      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21138,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "6. NON-COMPOSITE ALTERNATIVE (EN 1993-1-1)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2,
        "pageBreak": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21168,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Used only if composite action fails: η &lt; η_min, too few studs, or M_Rd(x) &lt; M_Ed(x) (chapter 4).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21193,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Composite action: 1 = yes (ch. 4), 0 = no (ch. 6)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_mp"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mq",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 21208,
      "props": {
        "w": 358,
        "h": 83,
        "baseline": 18,
        "latex": "c_{comp}\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ \\eta_{min}\\le\\eta\\land n_{req}\\le n_h\\land\\mathrm{UR}_{M.x}\\le1\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle 1\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle 0\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 0,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_mp"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21297,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "c_comp = 0, e.g. a large point load near a support: few studs fit between the support and x_M.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_ms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21322,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "The steel beam alone then carries every permanent-stage load, with no composite credit.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21347,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Studs are a minimum provision that restrains the top flange: L_LT = stud spacing (s ≤ s_max, 4.2).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 21372,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Utilisations only; acceptance is in chapter 7 for the design basis used (c_comp).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
